        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x^2+3)^2$",
          "worked": "The squared terms are $(x^2)^2$ and $3^2$. Check: $2\\times x^2\\times3=6x^2$.\n$$x^4+6x^2+9=(x^2+3)^2$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
