          "worked": "The squared terms are $(x^3)^2$ and $2^2$. Check: $2\\times x^3\\times2=4x^3$.\n$$x^6+4x^3+4=(x^3+2)^2$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      },
      {
        "id": "p27-q5-d",
