          "worked": "The squared terms are $(2x^2)^2$ and $3^2$. Check: $2\\times2x^2\\times3=12x^2$.\n$$4x^4+12x^2+9=(2x^2+3)^2$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
